translate ptBR qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_9715e826:

    # "They simply came, delivered bowls of food, and left in silence, leaving me to wait."
    "Eles simplesmente vinham, entregavam tigelas de comida, e saíam em silêncio, me deixando esperar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/JudgementDay/scr_JudgementDay_aio.rpy:2130
translate ptBR qst_JudgementDay_SiegeOverPrison_f7c2f1a3:

